    English: This squad has {0} players; at least 11 are required.
  - Key: adapter.goalkeeper
    Portuguese: Este elenco precisa de um goleiro de origem e 10 jogadores de linha.
    English: This squad needs a natural goalkeeper and 10 outfield-capable players.
  - Key: adapter.unsupportedVisual
    Portuguese: "Visual n\xE3o suportado para {0}. Apenas a apar\xEAncia integrada
      est\xE1 dispon\xEDvel."
    English: Unsupported visual for {0}. Only the built-in player appearance is available.
  - Key: adapter.missingAppearance
    Portuguese: "A apar\xEAncia local de {0} n\xE3o foi configurada."
    English: The local appearance for {0} has not been configured.
  - Key: adapter.defaultAppearance
    Portuguese: "Usando a apar\xEAncia padr\xE3o declarada para jogadores sem v\xEDnculo
      local."
    English: Using the declared default appearance for players without a local binding.
  - Key: adapter.outOfPosition
    Portuguese: "{0} jogador(es) atuar\xE3o fora de suas posi\xE7\xF5es de origem."
    English: '{0} player(s) will play outside their natural positions.'
  - Key: adapter.missingBadge
    Portuguese: "O escudo local do clube n\xE3o foi configurado."
    English: The local club badge has not been configured.
  - Key: adapter.missingKits
    Portuguese: "Os uniformes locais do clube n\xE3o foram totalmente configurados."
    English: The local club kits have not been fully configured.
